# The fisher's own figures: out of his door, out along the free walk to a shore of the lake, at the cast, and back. The layout stands
# the fisher in his building at 14,10 beside a lake to the east; each fast-forward stops at a moment, and each shot crops around
# the node the fisher stands on then. The layout's lake holds a lake detail of 0, so he catches nothing and walks back with no fish.
# Run it on the layout, under either content set:
#   sh tools/play-run.sh fisher --layout layouts/fisher.jsonc --fps 10
#   sh tools/play-run.sh fisher --layout layouts/fisher.jsonc --fps 10 --content-set basic
wait 0.3
fast-forward fisher state 0x10 max 20000
wait 0.3
list walking
shot walk 15 11 3 3
fast-forward fisher state 0x20 max 20000
wait 0.3
list casting
dump casting
shot cast 17 10 3 3
